  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing for Agricultural Small-and-Medium Enterprises in Africa (FASA) Fund(2025-2029/$ 5,000,000)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In summary, the use of ODA funding to support agri-SME finance can be an efficient and effective pathway to channel public funding for commercial capital leverage in support of agri-SMEs. Ultimately this can improve the food and agriculture industry in developing countries and enable food security.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the development of a new Multi-Donor First-Loss Facility which provide catalytic financing to Specialized Investment Funds addressing the funding needs across the Agri-SME missing middle. The Facility will at the same time seek to maximizing the leverage ratio to mobilize additional private capital.&#xc8fc;&#xc694; &#xacf5;&#xc5ec;&#xae30;&#xad00;&#xacfc; &#xd568;&#xaed8; &#xb300;&#xaddc;&#xbaa8; &#xd63c;&#xd569;&#xae08;&#xc735;&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5; &#xcd94;&#xc9c4;&#xc5d0;&#xb530;&#xb77c; &#xd63c;&#xd569;&#xae08;&#xc735;&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc7ac;&#xbb34;&#xc801; &#xcd94;&#xac00;&#xc131; &#xbc0f; &#xac1c;&#xbc1c;&#xd611;&#xb825; &#xd30c;&#xae09;&#xd6a8;&#xacfc; &#xd655;&#xb300; &#xae30;&#xb300;, &#xd63c;&#xd569;&#xae08;&#xc735;&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5; &#xcd94;&#xc9c4; &#xbc0f; &#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;, &#xc6b0;&#xb9ac; &#xae30;&#xc5c5; &#xcc38;&#xc5ec; &#xcd09;&#xc9c4; &#xbc0f; &#xd22c;&#xc790;&#xd65c;&#xc131;&#xd654; &#xae30;&#xc5ec; &#xac00;&#xb2a5;</narrative>
  </description>
